      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">4. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Chemicals In the Water</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> strums their guitar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">All sorts of colors project upon the water and riverbed over time.</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> steers with their hand. They notice the eerie sheen emanating from their hand. They grab ahold of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>’s hand and have them feel the water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>The water’s chemistry...
It’s greater than we can ever imagine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>While our chemistry...
It is not something that I imagined.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>The water’s chemistry...
It’s so reactive with all its hydrogen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Oh our chemistry...
It’s refreshing to tell you, my “friend.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Nothing’s in the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">wa</Text>
      <Text>-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> grabs a dead fish out of the water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>What I need to fish out of my soul...
This is what I now need you to know:
The colors are now altering my brain</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text>chemistry</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text>and</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text>my beliefs.
Our spectrums are aligning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I can’t believe you are saying this-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>There’re chemicals in the water turning my heart gay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Just how gay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Friggin</Text>
      <Text>’ gay!
</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="8" Style="AllCaps">
</Text>      <Text>There’re chemicals in the water turning my heart gay! So gay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Are you okay...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>There’re chemicals turning the water </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">friggin</Text>
      <Text>’ gay!
Colorful! Just look at the rainbows!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Oil sheen is either </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">projected</Text>
      <Text> in the water or </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> pull out colorful fabric from underneath their boat. The touch of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>’s hands into the water causes a ripple rainbow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Okay, I need to get it off my chest.
Here’re Couple gays in the same boat.
Your queerness now opens up our mind to</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text>all</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style="AllCaps"> </Text>
      <Text>possibilities.
Our feelings are so in line.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I can believe in love and science!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>There’re chemicals in the water turning our hearts gay! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Friggin</Text>
      <Text>’ gay! Queer water!
There’re chemicals in the water turning our hearts gay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> points to what are underneath the audience’s seats. The audience could play with the paper frogs on sticks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Friggin</Text>
      <Text>’ frogs!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Gay </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">rippit</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>There’re chemicals in the water turning our hearts-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Gay frogs jump </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>. Green papers, representing frogs, are tossed at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>Gay </Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">arse</Text>
          <Text> frogs!
End our rainbow.</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>This is so gay!
End this rainbow.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Let’s set things straight:
Boat jumping’s not okay.
You’re not on the menu on this date.
Even if you frogs are gay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>
There’re chemicals in the water turning the frogs gay/cray!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Friggin</Text>
      <Text>’ gay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Hoppin</Text>
      <Text>’ mad!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BenZENE &amp; VINYL</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>There’re chemicals in the water turning our hearts gay!
</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Friggin</Text>
      <Text>’ gay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The canoe capsizes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The frogs steal </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>’s guitar.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Chemicals In the Water</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 4</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#A6A6CACAF0F0" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 1/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE &amp; VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOTHER NATURE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Bottomless Ohio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> land.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So, you’ve never written a love song...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I said... “Wouldn’t dream of it.” </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">And are we in a dream</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> looks upon the frogs with the guitar in the distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Seems like we are...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What a nightmare...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Those gay frogs stole your guitar!</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Those gay frogs stole my rhythm!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The frogs seem gay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Aww, look...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Happy to make you frogs gay...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Mother Nature, you can be so pretty.</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Mother Nature, you are just so petty.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (Pre-RECORDED)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Benzene, you’re so sweet. Vinyl, you’re so heated.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Expose yourself!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (Pre-RECORDED)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re one too many exposures, Chemicals.
What are you doing lying around on my turf?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So sorry for anyone that does.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (Pre-RECORDED)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh, you’ll be sorry-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What Vinyl meant to say is that we hate Ohio!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s only natural that you hate it, too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (PRE-RECORDED)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mother Natures loves all her children, even Ohio most of the time. Now, are you here to harm my children?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We come in peace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (PRE-RECORDED)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Explain the rivers of dead children behind you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They are just fish...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (PRE-RECORDED)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I have Chemicals to fry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I don’t wanna die...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (PRE-RECORDED)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You did something worse to my children than death. You turned them gay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Friggin</Text>
      <Text>’</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic"> gay</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mother Nature, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">that</Text>
      <Text>’</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">s backwards of you to say</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mother Nature? More like...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Boomer Nature.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother NATURE (PRE-RECORDED)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re speaking to Earth’s most fabulous diva. I don’t need other forces of nature to one up me. What are you two up to?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Nothing toxic.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We got off on the wrong track.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (Pre-Recorded)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>When was the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Chemical Revolution</Text>
      <Text> ever on the right track? Since the days of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Faraday</Text>
      <Text>, your kind have been what’s wrong with the world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That can’t be. We’re cancers!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (Pre-RecorDEd)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Chemicals are literal cancers to planet Earth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re right. We’re nurturing and intrusive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (Pre-RecorDEd)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Invasive. Yeah, nurturing to the capital.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Look, nature. I don’t believe in this astrology nonsense.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOTHER NATURE (Pre-RecorDEd)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’ve lost my sense of smell from y’all. I’m losing my sense of time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">You know time</Text>
      <Text>’</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">s signature</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Tell Mother Nature</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Four </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">four</Text>
      <Text>. Three four. Common time. Cut time. Seven eight. Twelve eight. Several of them from Tool's </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">7empest</Text>
      <Text>. Six and a half eight in </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Schism</Text>
      <Text>-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Not those time- Whatever they are. What time is-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother NATURE (Pre-RecorDEd)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s time to get on home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>I’m not trying to head back to Michigan.</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>We’re trying to...</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (Pre-RecorDEd)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Follow the manmade trails that another cancerous species paved on me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh man...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Ohioans made this. Follow my lead again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>See you later, Mother Nature.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (Pre-RecorDEd)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m everywhere. I see everywhere. I’ll feel anywhere, capiche?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BenZENE &amp; VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I feel you.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 5</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#A6A6CACAF0F0" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="15" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Manmade Trails</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mother Nature has no right to say what our founding Chemicals fought for in the Chemical Revolution was wrong.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Were we wrong?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>For them to gain reactive radical independence for their valence?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They made compounds where they shouldn’t be.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They belonged here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The Chemicals drove out the Naturals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Beat out</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">The Chemicals beat out the Naturals</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They shouldn’t beat them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Then, they should’ve joined them?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We should’ve joined them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A fox enters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Joined them in the fox holes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> distances away from the fox.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> approaches the fox in awe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Aww... What’s your sign?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">RABV</Text>
      <Text>-G.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Gee. Judgmental much? They don’t have rabies!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Then, join them in </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">death</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to the fox)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Fella. Your silence will not fall on deaf ears. I am here-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 1/8" Page="16" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE &amp; VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOTHER NATURE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">5. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Kick Mother Nature In</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The fox attacks </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Get them off me! Ah! My atomic structure!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> tries to help.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hold still!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They’re going for my p-orbital!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Anywhere but there! That’s where you p-bond!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> whacks the fox off with a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text> pipe, killing them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (Pre-recorded)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>These manmade trails are not made for mankind, but my children. My guardians... defend your mother!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> wields a second </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text> pipe. They guard </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Reminds me of mosh pits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Orange fabrics, representing foxes, are tossed at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> bats each orange fabric away with ease.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(Repeating and batting)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Fake</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
          <Text>(Repeating)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>Mother Nature...</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
          <Text>(Repeating)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>I’ll fuck you up!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The orange fabrics stop attacking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Anything </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">new</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOther Nature (PrE-RECORDED)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Deploy all land troops!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The atmosphere turns as orange as the foxes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> swipes at the orange light. They get overrun.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There are too many! They’re on us!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> takes a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text> pipe and fights alongside </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Ionic bond!</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Mother NATURE (PRE-RECORDED)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Ironic response!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The atmosphere phases from orange to blood orange.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
          <Text>(Repeating)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>Mother Nature...</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
          <Text>(Repeating)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>We’ll fuck you up!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (PrE-RECORDED)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You sank my navy. Stomped my army. But, you cannot bring down my air force!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>An eagle soars by.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> hugs </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>We ain’t that kind of bond!</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>We ain’t that kind of Chemicals!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Wait, what...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The eagle cries.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’re not airborne chemicals! Ah!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> run about. They come across a town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Look! A town!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(Reading)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Cal... Calcutta? Ugh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Calcutta, California, Calgary, Caledonia, whatever! Run to safe toxicity!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The eagle cries.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> run to the town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Kick Mother Nature In</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 6</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#A6A6CACAF0F0" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 7/8" Page="19" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Calcutta</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> rest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Away, you go, winged monster!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Gee</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Judgmental much</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mother Nature is going to get a gift much worse than rabies. I assure you they will.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m not sure where we’re at.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You just said it: Calcutta.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>By the way, it’s nice of you to be cutting away those foxes with them disgusting </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> returns the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text> pipe to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You definitely need to wash the blood off this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> searches about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Bloody Hell.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Is there a pipe washing station around here?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s a little too deserted to be Calcutta.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What do you know about Calcutta?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>My cousin studied abroad there. They ate the best foods with pH of eight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You should visit them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They haven’t traveled abroad since. Well, they almost went to Beirut to visit their partner, Ammonium Nitrate, until they broke off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Broke off?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">TNT-scaled breakup</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Were they Lebanese?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Beats being Vietnamese and Ohioan. Have you been traveling a lot, musical nomad?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I once toured with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Norfolk Southern</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What band is that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Remember that band that was all over the news for...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>For...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Chicago River</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(Realizing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh shit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">They’re the band that dumped tons of shit onto a tour boat.</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Was that ever settled?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I would think </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">C9H9N</Text>
      <Text> settles well with H2O, no?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Let’s stop talking about skatoles, now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Poop</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Shut up. What were you during with Norfolk Southern?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I was taking over for </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Protopanaxadiol</Text>
      <Text>, their guitar who got injured getting off the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Pittsburgh Station Square</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Is that why you’re on the way to the Big Apple?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m there for myself. A free radical.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No one compares to</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style=""> </Text>
      <Text>an</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style=""> </Text>
      <Text>unpaired</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style=""> </Text>
      <Text>valence</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="10" Style=""> </Text>
      <Text>electron.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I want to live healthily and be remembered among the New York greats like Copper, Zinc, Sodium, Potassium, Magnesium, you get it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I guess.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But... Maybe being a solo artist isn’t all that it seems to be...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> looks through the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text> pipe directly at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Maybe you and your cousin could collaborate on an album.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Speaking of my cousin. They must have been doing remote work cause there’s no one here!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Ghost town or not, I’m always unseen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> puts down the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text> pipe. They extend their hand to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Let’s unsee together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 2/8" Page="21" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE &amp; VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">6. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">A Toxic Relationship</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> tango in the waltz of chemistry. They dance by buildings, where silhouettes of couples occupy. Healthy love is in the air for </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>, but they are spreading toxins into the air of mankind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> grows bored of this dance. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> takes notice and the waltz turns into the Apache dance. This demonstrates toxicity. They ferociously dance, unphased at the silhouettes of couples growing unstable inside the buildings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
          <Text>(Repeating)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>Dopamine!</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
          <Text>(Repeating)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>Cortisol.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> experience intimacy via chemistry by getting into each other’s atomic orbitals and sharing valence electrons.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; VINYL</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Oxytocin... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Aromatic Stabilization</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>“</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Chemicals in the Water</Text>
      <Text>” echoes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You know what floats on Chemicals in the water?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>A toxic relationship.</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>A ‘</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">tocin</Text>
          <Text> relationship?</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">A Toxic Relationship</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Everyone on the •OH: production team coughs with their masks on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There’s signs of life...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The atmosphere phases into signs of mankind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’re bringing out the ghosts in this town.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Holy nuclear winter, there are people here!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Calcutta has some strange-looking people.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well, they don’t look too healthy...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Audible sounds of the mob echo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They don’t sound too happy either. It’s the most toxic thing of them all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mankind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They also know all. You’re sweet. Tell them that we’re lost.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to the unseen mankind)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Excuse us, where is the exit?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The mob mumbles their answers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Oh out of the state is more than fine</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ve been wearing masks for years now, so another is not going to hurt. Okay, okay. We’ll get out of your hair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Vinyl, they look like they all lost their hair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey now. It’s not our fault you’re losing your hair, motor control, or sense of self. Don’t pit the blame on us!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Blame it on Ohio</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The mob seems disgruntled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Oh</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">they don’t seem to like that</Text>
      <Text>... Well, we’re just here living.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No, we’re not, Benzene. We’re not living in Ohio. People of Calcutta, where is the exit again?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Right</Text>
      <Text>... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">East</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Ope</Text>
      <Text>, excuse us. We’ll be on our way. You all are the ones with toxicity in your hearts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> walk east.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Everyone treats us like we’re toxic!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 7</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#A6A6CACAF0F0" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="24" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Bridge to PENNSYLVANIA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The bridge is foggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The bridge to Pennsylvania!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> nabs the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text> pipes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s the Vinyl countdown!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> steals back the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">PVC</Text>
      <Text> pipes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Benzene, you can count on it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BenZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’re going to get out of Ohio?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Out of this shithole.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We have to go through such shitting weather though...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No shit, this fog.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The notion of patience, it’s virtue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You want to stay another second in Ohio?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We have a ways to go before our atomic structure decays.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We will not stay another day, another minute, another second. Today, Benzene, today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Then, let’s go this way...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="25" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">7. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">I Can’t See Myself With YOu</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">








</Text>      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The eagle returns with a cry. The eagle swipes by in the fog.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> is pushed off the bridge onto the grounds below.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="25" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">I Can’t See Myself With You</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 8</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#A6A6CACAF0F0" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="26" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOTHER NATURE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Backward Ohio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> finds </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text>, blanketed by soil.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (Pre-Recorded)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I told ya. Mother Nature knows best.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m back in the muck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Fuck you, Mother Nature!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I finally belong to nature.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You write for Dow!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Doubt. I wrote in doubt. What do you write in?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I don’t know. Pop structure?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What emotion...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Heat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Bring it to me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>VINYL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re so reactive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You have the chance to be proactive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> tries to lift up </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>I’m too heavy for air.</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>I can’t stand it.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Go, Vinyl. Let this Chemical sink, alone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No, Benzene. We’re going to rise, together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Shut the fuck up...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> looks on, flabbergasted.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(Amusedly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>If we’re to be released into the air, let us be in control of what burns inside of us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> grabs a couple rocks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Long live Benzene and Vinyl.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Strike a match.</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>VINYL</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Strike a chord.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="27" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENZENE &amp; VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="HYDROXYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOTHER NATURE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VINYL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">8. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Airborne (The Fire is Normal)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text> strikes the two rocks together like a guitar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">In a controlled release, a fire starts.</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Sleep warm, my love.
They will see our light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I lie dying in soil. Soon airborne, reborn.
Flames roaring with pride.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The fire rises. The eagle dies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (Pre-Recorded)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>You ain’t shit, chemicals!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Look on the bright side:
we get to say goodbye.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Ohio...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>We’re to go out, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">outta</Text>
      <Text> style.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>This is just fine and dandy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Hydroxyl (Pre-Recorded)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I do not see any problems.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BENZENE &amp; VINYL</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>The fire is normal.
Everything is fine.
We will make light of it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (Pre-RecorDEd)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>You won’t win, chemicals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Benzene</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>The fire is normal.
We shall make light for we’re airborne.</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Vinyl</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>The fire is normal.
We shall make light of this New Normal.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Do you see us now?
World’s on fire.
It is the new normal.
Flames rising so high.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Mother Nature (Pre-RecorDEd)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Too bad for you, I need controlled fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Benzene &amp; Vinyl</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Look on the bright side:
We get to say goodbye. And hi / Up high, love...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Mother Nature</Text>
      <Text> coughs and chokes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BenZENE &amp; VINYL</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>It is the new... THe new normal!
This is just fine and normal.
The fire is normal.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The fire normalizes, swallowing up </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Benzene</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Vinyl</Text>
      <Text>. OH burns down, emitting air that is so rainbowy. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Chemicals in the Water</Text>
      <Text>” echoes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Blackout.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Airborne (The Fire is Normal)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act">
      <Text>End of Ohio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

